{{header special cards}}

'''Special Cards''' are [[cards]] that have a lower chance of appearing. They use a separate roll chance when a card is spawned.

The following is a complete list of the special cards:
* {{p|Suicide King}}
* {{p|Chaos Card}}
* {{p|Credit Card}}
* {{p|Rules Card}}
* {{p|A Card Against Humanity}}
* {{p| ? Card}}
* {{p|Get out of Jail Free Card}}
* {{p|Holy Card}}
* {{p|Huge Growth}}
* {{p|Ancient Recall}}
* {{p|Era Walk}}
* {{p|Wild Card}}
Despite being non-card consumables, the following are also considered '''special cards''' for spawning purposes, but can be excluded from some sources:
* {{p|Emergency Contact}}
* {{p|Dice Shard}}
* {{p|Cracked Key}}

== Different drop chances for Special Cards ==
* Generic Card drop / When {{c|Tainted Eden}} rerolls his consumable: 77.7% Tarot, 9.6% Rune, 8.6% Playing, 4.1% Special
* Eden Generation: 95.9% Tarot, 4.1% Special
* {{i|Deck of Cards}}, and the death of its wisp / {{i|Keeper's Box}} card? / {{i|Starter Deck}} pickup / {{i|Magic 8 Ball}} pickup: 86.3% Tarot, 9.6% Playing, 4.1% Special
* {{i|Booster Pack}} spawns:
** 1 out of 5 cards: 93.3% Playing, 6.67% special (can't be non-card consumable)
** 4 out of 5 cards: 65% Tarot, 20% Playing, 5% Special (can't be non-card consumable)

